  "feesApplyText": "<p>Please note that lettings agents are required by law to publish on their websites information for potential tenants about relevant fees, redress schemes and client money protection schemes (including the names of those schemes). For properties to rent in England, details of the agent's membership of any redress scheme and client money protection scheme must also be published with their fees. It is the agent's responsibility to ensure that all relevant information is provided and is up to date and accurate. If the relevant information does not appear here, the agent may have included it within the property description.</p><br /><p>\u00a0</p><br /><p><strong>Permitted Payments for Tenants</strong></p><br /><p><strong><br /></strong></p><br /><p>a) Rent</p><br /><p>\u00a0</p><br /><p>b) A security deposit of 5 weeks rent where the yearly rent is less than \u00a350,000 or 6 weeks where the rent is more than \u00a350,000.<br /><br />c) A refundable holding deposit equal to one weeks rent to reserve the property.<br /><br />d) Variation of tenancy at the request of the tenant - \u00a350 inc VAT or reasonable costs incurred if higher<br /><br />e) Payments in connection with early surrender of Tenancy at the tenants request.<br /><br />f) Payments for water, electricity, gas, council tax, tv licence, telephone & internet services.<br /><br />g) Default interest may be charged on a pro rata basis at 3% plus the Bank of England\u2019s base rate if rent payment is more than 14 days overdue.</p><br /><p>\u00a0</p><br /><p>h) A default payment for replacing keys, key fobs, garage remote controls or other security devices that the tenant has lost if required under terms of their tenancy agreement.</p><br /><p>\u00a0</p><br /><p><strong>Company lets/non housing act tenancies\u00a0</strong></p><br /><p>a) Tenancy start up administration fee - \u00a3100 inc VAT</p><br /><p>b) Tenancy renewal administration fee - \u00a378 inc VAT</p><br /><p>c)\u00a0Variation of tenancy at the request of the tenant - \u00a378 inc VAT or reasonable costs incurred if higher</p><br /><p>d)\u00a0Inventory check out fee of \u00a3120-\u00a3300 payable to the independent inventory clerk.\u00a0</p><br /><p>\u00a0</p><br /><p>Selmans Lettings Ltd are registered members of The Property Ombudsman independent redress scheme <a href=\" \" rel=\"nofollow\">(E685)</a>\u00a0. We are also members of CMP a client money protection scheme (<a href=\"../CompanyDocument/DownloadMedia/5\" rel=\"nofollow\">CMP002113.</a>).<br /></p><br /><p>\u00a0</p><br /><p>\u00a0</p><br /><p>\u00a0</p>",
